{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/798092-character-concept-solar-super-predator","id":798092,"title":"Character Concept: Solar Super-Predator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-01T21:18:38-08:00","id":798092,"title":"Character Concept: Solar Super-Predator","content":"While reading through the Occult charms, I thought the Spirit-based ones sounded REALLY predatory, what with all the corpus-devouring and power-stealing. How far can this be taken? Honestly, I can see this turning into that one Lunar charm (you know the one, &quot;I beat you in a contest and take one of your charms), only it becomes &quot;I eat you and take your charms&quot;. I'm probably wrong about that in particular, but am I right in seeing a really monstrous character concept here, or is that more Lunar in nature?<br /> <br /> Also, Soul Projection Method and its upgrades are specifically used to prevent and repair damage created by spirit possessions, but could a Solar create charms that would CAUSE that damage instead? Or is that too Abyssal in nature?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/899-the-free-man","name":"The Free Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar899_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T03:41:13-08:00","id":801262,"title":"","content":"I'm not versed enough in mechanics to contribute to this, but am I the only one who read the title expecting a Reagan era diatribe?<br /> <br /> Ah man, the simpler 80's.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T06:41:34-08:00","id":801347,"title":"","content":"I assumed it would be someone who wanted advice on making a feral Solar. I was going to advise Dawn with supernal Awareness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T09:09:03-08:00","id":801436,"title":"","content":"The God is dead, and we have killed him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T09:38:59-08:00","id":801456,"title":"","content":"I beat you and take your charms is already covered in Intergrity. For gods anyway. Divine Mantle.<br /> <br /> Gaining power through straight predation is well outside the Solar purview though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":414,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","user":"Gallus","date":". 01-05-2016, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T10:42:36-08:00","id":801499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kukla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/798092-character-concept-solar-super-predator?p=801436#post801436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The God is dead, and we have killed him.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/gJpOi.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T15:18:21-08:00","id":801625,"title":"","content":"That picture made my headache flair up. I wonder why.<br /> <br /> A Solar could have barbarian or feral aesthetic and take the various charms in Awareness, Survival, and Integrity. They could take a Brawl or the Tiger-Style MA. However, a Solar is more likely to read as super-hunter than super-predator. Especially once Lunars comes around and they have solid mechanical support for their predation.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Free Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/798092-character-concept-solar-super-predator#post798092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, Soul Projection Method and its upgrades are specifically used to prevent and repair damage created by spirit possessions, but could a Solar create charms that would CAUSE that damage instead? Or is that too Abyssal in nature?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's sort of Abyssal but I'd probably allow it at my table if the player showed how it fit the PC. One charm isn't going to disrupt the thematic niche of the Abyssals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T15:21:43-08:00","id":801628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gallus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/798092-character-concept-solar-super-predator?p=801456#post801456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I beat you and take your charms is already covered in Intergrity. For gods anyway. Divine Mantle.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm talking about the Occult charm Ghost Eating Technique and its enhancements. The Solar is tearing spirits apart, taking (or &quot;Eating&quot;) their motes, and, eventually, their powers through Carnal Spirit Rending and <i>its</i> enhancements.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Gaining power through straight predation is well outside the Solar purview though. </div> </div> </div>Not EXACTLY predation, but it certainly does sound predatory in nature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/899-the-free-man","name":"The Free Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar899_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-11T15:44:46-08:00","id":806533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Free Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/798092-character-concept-solar-super-predator?p=801628#post801628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm talking about the Occult charm Ghost Eating Technique and its enhancements. The Solar is tearing spirits apart, taking (or &amp;quot;Eating&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> their motes, and, eventually, their powers through Carnal Spirit Rending and <i>its</i> enhancements.<br /> <br /> <br /> Not EXACTLY predation, but it certainly does sound predatory in nature.</div> </div> </div> </div> Not <i>quite</i> what you were thinking of, but Revlid made some Abyssal charms for 2e that were based on a similar idea of power through consuming spirits. I <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/806528-2nd-edition-repost-abyssal-occult-charms-by-revlid-bon-appetit\">just reposted them, if you want to take a gander.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}